Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,420] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么你一直在赚钱
Segment #2   [00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:03,080] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 就永远过着很穷和的生活
Segment #3   [00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,860] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为这个社会的设计就是这么的精巧
Segment #4   [00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,020] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 15 | Text: 如果不去刻意抵制某种生活方式的诱惑
Segment #5   [00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,440] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者说教训吧
Segment #6   [00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,160] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 作为一个打工人来说
Segment #7   [00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,440] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 输入再多也剩不下来什么
Segment #8   [00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:19,120] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 13 | Text: 资本跟社会就是会不断的告诉我们大家
Segment #9   [00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,340] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 如何生活 如何消费
Segment #10  [00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,860] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个系统就希望去做一个消费者
Segment #11  [00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,660] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 做一个左手进右手出
Segment #12  [00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:28,160] | Elapsed:  13.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 存不下任何资产的消费者
Segment #13  [00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,100] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看那个出租车司机一天金属
Segment #14  [00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,100] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 6  | Text: 也要打几百万
Segment #15  [00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,720] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 13 | Text: 那小饭店一月流水也得十几万
Segment #16  [00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,300] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是那不是属于他们的钱
Segment #17  [00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,780] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 12 | Text: 事实上每一个无法利用规则的人
Segment #18  [00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:43,260] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 10 | Text: 都会成为规则下的NPC
Segment #19  [00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:44,820] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的一切
Segment #20  [00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:48,240] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 17 | Text: 一切的代价和需求都会被计算的清清楚楚
Segment #21  [00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,760] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 出租车司机的分子钱
Segment #22  [00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,560] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 8  | Text: 外卖选隔的客栏价
Segment #23  [00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:55,060] | Elapsed:  27.49s | Words: 9  | Text: 餐饮老板的平台抽点
Segment #24  [00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,960] | Elapsed:  43.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 互联网大厂
Segment #25  [00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,520] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 那些高薪的人才
Segment #26  [00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,220] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 同样背着高额的房贷
Segment #27  [00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,600] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 各种天意无缝的设计
Segment #28  [00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,660] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 10 | Text: 会利用你现阶段的需求
Segment #29  [00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,960] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 把你的生活属于平
Segment #30  [00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,700] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 正好卡在刚刚好
Segment #31  [00:01:08,260 --> 00:01:08,940] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 多一点少一点
Segment #32  [00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:09,920] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 刚刚好
Segment #33  [00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:13,560] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 12 | Text: 能够存活差一点就崩溃的状态
Segment #34  [00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,580] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 13 | Text: 那除非你有勇气跳出游戏的规则
Segment #35  [00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:18,440] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 5  | Text: 重新审视自己
Segment #36  [00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:20,520] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 找出新的道路
Segment #37  [00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:22,240] | Elapsed:  43.66s | Words: 11 | Text: 否则你只能在这种规则下
Segment #38  [00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,160] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的服求
Segment #39  [00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:26,680] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的焦虑
Segment #40  [00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,560] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 不断的自闭
Segment #41  [00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,460] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 10 | Text: 你但是对于大多数人来说
Segment #42  [00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,000] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 这种机会
Segment #43  [00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,720] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实我感觉是非常少的
Segment #44  [00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,420] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 作为一个被精算过的生活成本
Segment #45  [00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:36,840] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 被系统压榨的NPC
Segment #46  [00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,760] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 这就是人在一生的宿命
Segment #47  [00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,860] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个系统由市场产生
Segment #48  [00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:43,100] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 由资本操控
Segment #49  [00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:46,220] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 由无数个聪明的头脑
Segment #50  [00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:48,400] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 在千百个行业里各自设计
Segment #51  [00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:50,140] | Elapsed:  58.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 并且逐渐
Segment #52  [00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:52,380] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 12 | Text: 向越来越极限的方向去发展
Segment #53  [00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,320] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 外卖小格从一单
Segment #54  [00:01:54,820 --> 00:01:56,120] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 天天楼上楼下跑
Segment #55  [00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,800] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 送一单能挣七八块钱
Segment #56  [00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,660] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 用金变成了三四块
Segment #57  [00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:00,540] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 3  | Text: 两三块
Segment #58  [00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:03,440] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 13 | Text: 时间从三十分钟变成了二十分钟
Segment #59  [00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,380] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 出租车司机
Segment #60  [00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,460] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 游车变成了电车
Segment #61  [00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,700] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 你看着大概可能节省成本了
Segment #62  [00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:11,920] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 13 | Text: 随分子两百月涨到六百一千了
Segment #63  [00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,220] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 12 | Text: 你现在上哪去参加个红白骑士
Segment #64  [00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,760] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 11 | Text: 你拿二百块钱能拿出手吗
Segment #65  [00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:17,640] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 生活成本越来越高
Segment #66  [00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,960] | Elapsed:  76.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 你收入高那点有什么用
Segment #67  [00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,860] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 5  | Text: 只要一个行业
Segment #68  [00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:21,600] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 一个领域
Segment #69  [00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,260] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 有一部分人的效率输入
Segment #70  [00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,040] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 得到了提升
Segment #71  [00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:24,900] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 得到了突破
Segment #72  [00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,860] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 11 | Text: 那这个系统就会勒紧每一分
Segment #73  [00:02:27,860 --> 00:02:29,060] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 6  | Text: 每一个人的扩大
Segment #74  [00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:29,900] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 每一分钱
Segment #75  [00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,980] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 所以说赚五十万和赚五万
Segment #76  [00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:32,600] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 3  | Text: 真的不重要
Segment #77  [00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,940] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 重要的是每一个人都在燃烧着
Segment #78  [00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:35,740] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 自己的生命
Segment #79  [00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:37,280] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 8  | Text: 去供养着这套系统
Segment #80  [00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,700] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 7  | Text: 供养着这套系统
Segment #81  [00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:41,460] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 10 | Text: 大厂的设计转到了零零七
Segment #82  [00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:42,620] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 2  | Text: 薪资
Segment #83  [00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:43,580] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 4  | Text: 涨到了五万
Segment #84  [00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:46,080] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 9  | Text: 房价也涨到了五万八万
Segment #85  [00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:48,520] | Elapsed:  95.03s | Words: 12 | Text: 穷的是规则下所有人共同的宿命
Segment #86  [00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,780] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 因为我们生来就是气氛族
Segment #87  [00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,120] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 生来就是气氛族
Segment #88  [00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,260] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 富人的财产
Segment #89  [00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:55,460] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 从来不是金银珠宝
Segment #90  [00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,420] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 而是我们穷人
Segment #91  [00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,300] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说你要真想
Segment #92  [00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:00,240] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 活得不这么累
Segment #93  [00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,900] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 就要一直去抵制
Segment #94  [00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:04,240] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 抵制资本对于我们的心脑
Segment #95  [00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:06,500] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 而且是规则上的东西
Segment #96  [00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:08,680] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 抵制这些规则
Segment #97  [00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:11,820] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 抵制某种生活方式的用户
Segment #98  [00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,600] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油梦生人
Segment #99  [00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,540] | Elapsed: 110.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
Segment #100 [00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:18,420] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 同时做一个政治感善良的人
Segment #101 [00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:18,720] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
Segment #102 [00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,080] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 11 | Text: 最后一句话说得有点微信
Segment #103 [00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:24,460] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
Segment #104 [00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,360] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 12 | Text: 无论经历了怎样的风吹雨打
Segment #105 [00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:30,920] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们仍然要按照自己的活法
Segment #106 [00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,140] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 去笑着迎接生活的每一天
Segment #107 [00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:34,620] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 对 这样说
Segment #108 [00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:37,140] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 人在社会上说了很多
Segment #109 [00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:39,560] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 言不住忧忡的话
Segment #110 [00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,780] | Elapsed: 123.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 做了很多声不由己的事
Segment #111 [00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:45,100] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 没办法 生活就这样
Segment #112 [00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:48,820] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 不是所有的人都能微信所欲
Segment #113 [00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:51,440] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 不能去唱所欲言的
Segment #114 [00:03:54,380 --> 00:03:55,040] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 2  | Text: 就这样
Segment #115 [00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,500] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油梦生人
Segment #116 [00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:58,780] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 还是祝你们越来越好
Segment #117 [00:03:58,780 --> 00:03:59,060] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 1  | Text: 好吧
Segment #118 [00:03:59,060 --> 00:03:59,960] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 虽然我知道你们
Segment #119 [00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,700] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 可能会好可能会不好
Segment #120 [00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,480] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是我还要祝你们越来越好
Segment #121 [00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:05,460] | Elapsed: 133.76s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
